Note to self (last update: 6 May 2024)

=================================================================
time series for Australian CPI for week 10 and 11 lab:
=================================================================

The data are provided by the Reserve Bank of Australia (on their website then navigate to "Inflation and Inflation Expectations")

Download their "Consumer Price Inflation - G1" spreadsheet

In it, the B column "Consumer Price Index" is the correct one.
(Notice: sometimes they change the index month which changes all entries but that isn't a problem as the entire data set is updated.)




=================================================================
time series for US GDP for week 12 lab:
=================================================================

From FRED, enter "GDPC1"